    "description": "Evil Essence 10.3 - Darkness. Spells to create and control areas of darkness, utterdark, shadow forms, and night/darkvision. See Section 15.12 (p. 98) for visibility. See Section 15.14 (p. 98) for illusions. See Section 15.24 (p. 101) for evil spell lists.",
