          "type": "E",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Creates an area of up to 20' radius about the point touched. The darkness is equal to the darkest night. If the point is on a mobile target, it will move with the target. See Section 15.12 (p. 98)."
